@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam dpi 120
hide empty members
top to bottom direction
title SkyCrop - IAM — Identity and Access Management - Diseño por capas
package "Interfaces / Presentation" {
class AccountController <<controller>> {
-service: IAccountApplicationService
+authenticate(request: AuthenticateRequest): AccessTokenResource
}
class AuthenticateRequest <<request>> {
-username: String
-password: String
}
class AccessTokenResource <<resource>> {
-token: String
-expiresAt: Timestamp
}
class AccessTokenIssuer <<token issuer>> {
+issue(accountId: Long): AccessTokenResource
}
}
package "Application" {
class AuthenticateCommand <<command>> {
-username: String
-password: String
}
interface IAccountApplicationService {
+authenticate(command: AuthenticateCommand): AccessTokenResource
}
class AccountApplicationService <<application service>> {
-repository: IAccountRepository
+authenticate(command: AuthenticateCommand): AccessTokenResource
}
}
package "Domain" {
class Account <<aggregate root>> {
-id: Long
-username: String
-passwordHash: String
-status: AccountStatus
+authenticate(): boolean
}
interface IAccountRepository <<repository contract>> {
+findByUsername(username: String): Account [0..1]
+save(entity: Account): void
}
}
package "Infrastructure" {
class AccountRepository <<repository>> {
-dbContext: SkyCropDbContext
+findByUsername(username: String): Account [0..1]
+save(entity: Account): void
}
class SkyCropDbContext <<EF Core>> {
+saveChanges(): int
}
}
AccountController --> IAccountApplicationService : delega
AccountController ..> AuthenticateRequest : recibe
AccountController ..> AuthenticateCommand : construye
AccountController ..> AccessTokenResource : responde
AccountApplicationService ..|> IAccountApplicationService
IAccountApplicationService ..> AuthenticateCommand : recibe
AccountApplicationService --> IAccountRepository : consulta y persiste
AccountApplicationService ..> Account : ejecuta operaciones
AccountApplicationService ..> AccessTokenIssuer : transforma
AccessTokenIssuer ..> AccessTokenResource : produce
AccountRepository ..|> IAccountRepository
IAccountRepository ..> Account : contrato de persistencia
AccountRepository --> SkyCropDbContext : acceso a datos
package "Application" {
interface ICredentialVerifier <<integration contract>> {
+verify(password: String, passwordHash: String): boolean
}
}
package "Infrastructure" {
class PasswordHashVerifier <<adapter>> {
+verify(password: String, passwordHash: String): boolean
}
}
AccountApplicationService --> ICredentialVerifier : solicita operación
PasswordHashVerifier ..|> ICredentialVerifier
note bottom of PasswordHashVerifier
Comprueba las credenciales sin devolver la contraseña ni su hash.
end note
AccountController -[hidden]down-> AccountApplicationService
AccountApplicationService -[hidden]down-> Account
Account -[hidden]down-> AccountRepository
legend bottom
Arquitectura de clases propuesta para el backend RESTful API.
La vista muestra un caso de uso del contexto y la verificación de credenciales.
Los atributos del agregado se detallan en las vistas del dominio.
Las dependencias de infraestructura implementan contratos internos.
endlegend
@enduml
